resources.string:
If you accept, only when you tap «Describe with AI» Aura sends to the Aura AI server (or to your own AI provider, if you set your key in Settings ▸ AI Lyrics Translation):
• the names of up to 8 of your most played artists and how many times you played them;
• up to 5 genres and how many times they appear;
• up to 4 decades of your most played songs and how many songs there are from each;
• the language of the app.
No dates or times of your listening, no song titles, no account, no e-mail and no identifier of any kind are sent. The Aura AI server does not keep the content; your IP is kept for at most 48 hours to limit requests. You can withdraw this permission at any time.
